# airport.pem: a stray generation artifact only — UNUSED by the build. The AirPort
# Express RSA key is the PUBLIC, well-known RAOP key and is deliberately embedded as C
# arrays in src/airport_key.c. Nothing secret here; this line just keeps the scratch
# .pem out of the tree.
airport.pem
